cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Block Reality in teaching or research, please cite the software and the exact release."
title: "Block Reality: Structural Analysis in Minecraft"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Rocky"
    alias: "rocky59487"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Minecraft 1.20.1 mod that extracts structural blocks into
  6-DOF beam members and MITC4 shell facets, solves them in an out-of-process
  finite-element backend, and returns stress contours, demand/capacity ratios,
  mechanism diagnostics, and linear buckling results to the game.
keywords:
  - finite element method
  - structural analysis
  - engineering education
  - Minecraft
  - MITC4
  - beam element
repository-code: "https://github.com/rocky59487/block-reality"
url: "https://github.com/rocky59487/block-reality"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.1a"
date-released: "2026-08-20"
